        "deletedAt": null,
        "name": "Basket Case Chords by Green Day",
        "content": "* Basket Case\n** Green Day\n\nCapo\\: 1st fret · Key\\: Eb\n\nVerse 1:\n[D]Do you have the [A]time\nTo [Bm]listen to me [F#m]whine\nA[G]bout nothing and [D]everything\nAll [A]at once\n\n[D]I am one of [A]those\nMe[Bm]lodramatic [F#m]fools\nNeu[G]rotic to the [D]bone\nNo doubt about [A]it\n\nChorus:\n  [G]Sometimes I [A]give myself th[D]e creeps\n  [G]Sometimes my [A]mind plays tricks o[D]n me\nIt [G]all keeps adding [A]up\nI [D]think I'm [C]cracking [Bm]up\nAm [G]I just para[A]noid?\n          (D*)\nAm I just stoned?\n\nRiff:\n[D A Bm A]\n[D A Bm A]\n\nVerse 2:\nI [D]went to a [A]shrink\nTo [Bm]analyze my [F#m]dreams\nShe [G]says it's lack of [D]sex\nThat's bringing [A]me down\nI [D]went to a [A]whore\nHe [Bm]said my life's a [F#m]bore\nSo [G]quit my whining [D]cause\nIt's bringing [A]her down\n\nChorus:\n  [G]Sometimes I [A]give myself t[D]he creeps\n  [G]Sometimes my [A]mind plays tricks o[D]n me\nIt [G]all keeps adding [A]up\nI [D]think I'm [C]cracking [Bm]up\nAm [G]I just para[A]noid?\n              (D*)\nUh, yuh, yuh, ya\n\nRiff:\n[D A Bm A]\n[D A Bm A]\n[D A Bm A]\n[D A Bm A]\n\nBridge:\n[G]Grasping to con[A]trol\n[N.C.]So I better h[D]old on\n\nInstrumental:\n[D A Bm F#m G D A]\n[D A Bm F#m G D A]\n\nChorus:\n  [G]Sometimes I [A]give myself t[D]he creeps\n  [G]Sometimes my [A]mind plays tricks o[D]n me\nIt [G]all keeps adding [A]up\nI [D]think I'm [C]cracking [Bm]up\nAm [G]I just para[A]noid?\nAm I just [(D)]stoned?\n\nOutro:\n[D Bm G D A]\n[D Bm G D A]\n[D Bm G D A]\n[D Bm G D A]\n[G D A]\n",
        "favorite": false,
        "settings": {},
