        "deletedAt": null,
        "name": "hallelujah",
        "content": "* Hallelujah\n** Leonard Cohen\n\n1.: I've h[C]eard there was a s[Am]ecret chord\n   That [C]David played, and it [Am]pleased the Lord.\n   But [F]you don't really [G]care for music, [C]do you?[G]\n   It [C]goes like this, the [F]fourth, the [G]fifth\n   The [Am]minor fall, the [F]major lift\n   The [G]baffled king com[E7]posing Halle[Am]lujah\n\nR:: Halle[F]lujah, Halle[Am]lujah\n   Halle[F]lujah, Halle[C]lu-uu[G]uu-u[C]jah\n\n2.: Your faith [C]was strong but you needed [Am]proof\n   You s[C]aw her bathing on [Am]the roof\n   Her [F]beauty and the [G]moonlight o[C]verthrew you[G]\n   She[C] tied you To a[F] kitchen cha[G]ir\n   She[Am] broke your throne, and she [F]cut your hair\n   And [G]from your lips she [E7]drew the H[Am]allelujah\n\nR:: Hallelujah .....\n\n3.: You say I took the name in vain\n   I don't even know the name\n   [F]But if I did, w[G]ell really,[C] what's it t[G]o you?\n   There's a blaze of light In every word\n   It doesn't matter which you heard\n   The holy or the broken Hallelujah\n\nR:: Hallelujah .....\n\n4.: I [C]did my best, it wa[Am]sn't much\n   I couldn't feel, so I tried to touch\n   I've told the truth, I didn't come to fool you\n   And even though It all went wrong\n   I'll stand before the Lord of Song\n   With nothing on my tongue but Hallelujah\n\n\n",
        "favorite": false,
        "settings": {},
        "cache": {
          "title": "Hallelujah",
          "subtitle": "Leonard Cohen"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "dc5c63b2-6632-4876-9396-e9b20fefb569",
